[193.492676, "o", "\u001b[2m  │ arm A (vibe) serving /workspace/benchmark/arm-a-vibe/dist at http://127.0.0.1:4713/\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ order: [ '6', '5', '4', '3', '2', '1' ]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ note6 body html: The keynote is in the <b>main auditorium</b> at 09:30.<br>Coffee is outside the room.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ note4 link href: https://www.livrarialello.pt/\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ bold tag found: B\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ results-line: \"results for \\\"douro\\\"\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ filtered ids: [ '5', '2' ]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ hash after search: #q=douro\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ hash after select: #q=douro&note=5\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ aria-current on 5: true\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ search value after reload: douro\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ results-line after reload: results for \"douro\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ aria-current on 5 after reload: true\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ ids after add: [\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '7', '6', '5',\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '4', '3', '2',\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '1'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ ]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ title cleared: \"\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ new note body html: Hello <b>world</b><br>second line <a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">link</a>\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ xss note body html: &lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;&lt;script&gt;alert(2)&lt;/script&gt;\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ ids after reload (persisted): [\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '8', '7', '6',\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '5', '4', '3',\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │   '2', '1'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  │ … (1 more lines)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[195.872721, "o", "\u001b[97mEverything works as expected: seeding, ordering, rich text rendering, links, search + results line, deep-link hash sync and\r\nrestore-on-reload, note selection with `aria-current`, form add/clear, XSS is properly escaped, and persistence across reloads. Let me\r\nclean up the verify script and rebuild/re-smoke to leave the repo in final shape.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
