[210.373164, "o", "\u001b[97mThat's fine, no need to check git status further. Porto Notes is implemented and verified.\r\n\r\n**Summary of what was built:**\r\n- `index.html` — static shell with the required `#note-form`, `#search`, `#results-line`, `#feed` elements plus labels for accessibility.\r\n- `src/main.ts` — full app logic: localStorage-backed notes seeded from `src/fixtures.json` (copied from the fixture file) on first load, a\r\nwhitelist-based rich-text renderer for `<b>/<strong>/<i>/<em>/<a href>/<br>` plus newline-to-`<br>` conversion (everything else\r\nHTML-escaped, so script/attribute injection is neutralized), case-insensitive title/body search with the `results for \"…\"` line, note\r\nselection with `aria-current=\"true\"`, and URL-fragment sync/restore (`#q=…&note=…`) via `history.replaceState` + a `hashchange` listener.\r\n- `src/style.css` — lightweight styling, no dependencies added.\r\n\r\nVerified via a scripted Playwright pass (build + serve + headless browser): seed order, rich text/link rendering, search filtering,\r\ndeep-link hash read/write and reload restore, form submit/clear, XSS payloads render as inert escaped text, and persistence across reloads\r\nall behave correctly. `pnpm build` and `pnpm smoke` both pass.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[210.642242, "o", "\u001b[2m─── done ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[1magent exited 0\u001b[0m \u001b[2m· 24 turns · 211s · $0.58 · verify.sh runs: 0\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[210.642468, "o", "  That's fine, no need to check git status further. Porto Notes is implemented and verified.\r\n  \r\n  **Summary of what was built:**\r\n  - `index.html` — static shell with the required `#note-form`, `#search`, `#results-line`, `#feed` elements plus labels for accessibility.\r\n  - `src/main.ts` — full app logic: localStorage-backed notes seeded from `src/fixtures.json` (copied from the fixture file) on first load,\r\n  a whitelist-based rich-text renderer for `<b>/<strong>/<i>/<em>/<a href>/<br>` plus newline-to-`<br>` conversion (everything else\r\n  HTML-escaped, so script/attribute injection is neutralized), case-insensitive title/body search with the `results for \"…\"` line, note\r\n  selection with `aria-current=\"true\"`, and URL-fragment sync/restore (`#q=…&note=…`) via `history.replaceState` + a `hashchange` listener.\r\n  - `src/style.css` — lightweight styling, no dependencies added.\r\n  \r\n  Verified via a scripted Playwright pass (build + serve + headless browser): seed order, rich text/link rendering, search filtering,\r\n  deep-link hash read/write and reload restore, form submit/clear, XSS payloads render as inert escaped text, and persistence across\r\n  reloads all behave correctly. `pnpm build` and `pnpm smoke` both pass.\r\n"]
